  "contract": "The original DLL supports twenty specialization slots. The original slot swap spells select slots through\neffect 162, with a five-second interruptible cast. A Tome unlocks a slot by teaching its swap spell. A\nslot is an independent preset, separate from ChrSpecs archetype identity: a fresh slot has no chosen\narchetype or purchased talents, and returning to a slot restores its own build and action bar. Source:\noriginal AscCAMgr Player::Ensure/Get and OnActiveSpec, Spell.dbc 979993/979994 and ItemSpells.dbc 106954.\nNative removals and resets retain their original prices; fixture actors have 100 gold to pay them.\nArchetype-only uploads inside a slot remove omitted purchases and require explicit repurchase; slot casts\nstill restore saved presets and packed action bars.\nThe original client talent-purge payment token is 0xE06FB (919291), consumed once by the native reset.\nUse that token at level 11, whose original gold polynomial wraps a negative result; preserve client pricing.",
